sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as 🖥️ CLI
    participant Agent as 🤖 Agent Router
    participant OpenAI as ☁️ OpenAI
    participant Tool as 🔧 Tool
    participant DuckDB as 🗃️ DuckDB
    participant Phoenix as 🌐 Phoenix

    User->>CLI: ask "Which stores did best?"
    CLI->>Phoenix: setup_tracing()
    CLI->>Agent: ask(question)

    Agent->>Phoenix: start span [AGENT]
    Agent->>OpenAI: messages + tools schema
    OpenAI-->>Agent: tool_call: lookup_sales_data

    Agent->>Phoenix: start span [TOOL]
    Agent->>Tool: lookup_sales_data(prompt)
    Tool->>OpenAI: generate SQL
    OpenAI-->>Tool: SELECT ... FROM parquet
    Tool->>DuckDB: execute SQL
    DuckDB-->>Tool: DataFrame
    Tool-->>Agent: data as string
    Agent->>Phoenix: end span [TOOL]

    Agent->>OpenAI: messages + tool result
    OpenAI-->>Agent: tool_call: analyze_sales_data

    Agent->>Phoenix: start span [TOOL]
    Agent->>Tool: analyze_sales_data(prompt, data)
    Tool->>OpenAI: interpret data
    OpenAI-->>Tool: analysis text
    Tool-->>Agent: analysis
    Agent->>Phoenix: end span [TOOL]

    Agent->>OpenAI: messages + tool result
    OpenAI-->>Agent: final answer (no tool_calls)

    Agent->>Phoenix: end span [AGENT]
    Agent-->>CLI: answer text
    CLI-->>User: prints answer
